step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak to King Narnode Shareen at the Grand Tree.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the tree and take the glider to Gandius.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you don't have the monkey bones yet, you can kill a monkey nearby for some. (If you have started Tai Bwo Wannai Trio, only a monkey corpse will drop. That will work as well)</str>
