step	31	-	Quick guide step 31
line	<str>Speak to King Narnode Shareen at the Grand Tree.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the tree and take the glider to Gandius.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you don't have the monkey bones yet, you can kill a monkey nearby for some. (If you have started Tai Bwo Wannai Trio, only a monkey corpse will drop. That will work as well)</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the Shipyard gate to the north. Make sure you have the Royal Seal with you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with G.L.O. Caranock in the building south of the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to King Narnode and speak to him. (Make sure you have 1 inventory space free as he will drop Narnode's orders to the floor otherwise).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Daero in the bar on the uk=1 (east side) of the Grand Tree. Make sure to go through all of the Chat Options to be teleported to a new location.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk (not "travel") to Daero again inside the hangar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click the panel in the south-eastern region of the hangar and solve the sliding puzzle. (guide here)</str>
line	
line	<str>Watch the cutscene. Talk to Daero, then Waydar to fly to Crash Island.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lumdo.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk (not "travel") to Waydar twice, who will convince Lumdo to follow orders.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lumdo again to travel west to Ape Atoll.</str>
line	
line	<str>On the island, follow the red path on the map into the valley. You will be shot and arrested.</str>
line	
line	<str>Watch the guards' pattern, pick the lock on your cell door and escape the prison.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the green path and talk to Garkor (Complete dialogue or Zooknock will not give you the m'speak amulet).</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the blue path to the U-shaped building and enter through the southern door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the stacked crates on the light brown floor for Monkey dentures. (Complete the dialogue)</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the south-eastern crate to fall into a cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crates in the north-west for a M'amulet mould.</str>
line	
line	<str>You may now teleport away.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now is an ideal time to resupply at a bank before heading into the Ape Atoll Dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ape Atoll by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the yellow path west and climb down the ladder into the Ape Atoll Dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run to the end of the dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Zooknock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your Monkey dentures, M'amulet mould, and Gold bar on Zooknock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport away, then return by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the red path, get arrested, escape, then follow the pink path to the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>(Note: bearded guards cannot be walked through!) Enter the trapdoor. You may need to climb up the ladder to the south then down in the east to avoid the gorillas.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>With a <col=800000>M'amulet mould</col> in your inventory, use the <col=800000>Enchanted bar</col> with a wall of flames, then string it with your <col=800000>Ball of wool</col> to create the <col=800000>M'speak amulet</col>.</col>
