line	<str>Search the south-eastern crate to fall into a cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crates in the north-west for a M'amulet mould.</str>
line	
line	<str>You may now teleport away.</str>
line	
line	<str>Now is an ideal time to resupply at a bank before heading into the Ape Atoll Dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Ape Atoll by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the yellow path west and climb down the ladder into the Ape Atoll Dungeon.</str>
