line	
line	<str>Run to the end of the dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Give Zooknock your <col=800000>Monkey talisman</col> and <col=800000>Monkey bones</col> (make sure these are bones from the regular monkeys; examine Text: These are small monkey bones.). After a moment he will give you a <col=800000>Greegree</col>.</col>
