done	<str>Return to Ape Atoll by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the yellow path west and climb down the ladder into the Ape Atoll Dungeon.</str>
done	
done	<str>Run to the end of the dungeon.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Zooknock.</str>
done	
done	<str>Use your Monkey dentures, M'amulet mould, and Gold bar on Zooknock.</str>
done	
done	<str>Teleport away, then return by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the red path, get arrested, escape, then follow the pink path to the temple.</str>
done	
done	<str>(Note: bearded guards cannot be walked through!) Enter the trapdoor. You may need to climb up the ladder to the south then down in the east to avoid the gorillas.</str>
done	
done	<str>With a M'amulet mould in your inventory, use the Enchanted bar with a wall of flames, then string it with your Ball of wool to create the M'speak amulet.</str>
done	
done	<str>Optional: If you plan on doing the Freeing King Awowogei section of Recipe for Disaster:</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the pink path back to the jail, then the cyan path to the Monkey child's house.</str>
done	
done	<str>Equip your M'speak amulet and talk to the monkey child.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the monkey child twice more.</str>
done	
done	<str>Pick 5 Bananas from the trees in the garden.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the monkey child to give him the bananas.</str>
done	
done	<str>Leave the garden and wait for the aunt to pass through.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the monkey child to get a Monkey talisman.</str>
done	
done	<str>Optional: If you plan on doing the Freeing King Awowogei section of Recipe for Disaster:</str>
done	
done	<str>Teleport away, then return by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo.</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the yellow path west and climb down the ladder.</str>
done	
done	<str>Run to the end of the dungeon.</str>
done	
done	<str>Give Zooknock your Monkey talisman and Monkey bones (make sure these are bones from the regular monkeys; examine Text: These are small monkey bones.). After a moment he will give you a Greegree.</str>
done	
done	<str>Optional: If you plan on doing the Freeing King Awowogei section of Recipe for Disaster:</str>
done	
done	<str>Note: Teleporting while wielding the Greegree will force it into your inventory. If your inventory is full then it will be dropped. If unnoticed, the Greegree can be lost.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the Ardougne Zoo and equip your Karamjan monkey greegree, then talk to the Monkey minder. If you haven't talked to him before, click through his dialogue (ask any question), then equip the Karamjan monkey greegree.</str>
done	
done	<str>Equip your M'speak amulet and talk to a monkey, it will jump in your bag.</str>
done	
done	<str>Remove your greegree and talk to the minder again.</str>
done	
done	<str>Travel by foot (walk or run) back to the Grand Tree, then return to Ape Atoll by talking to Daero, Waydar, and Lumdo. Do not use any means of teleportation.</str>
done	
done	<str>Equip your M'speak amulet and Karamjan monkey greegree. Ape Atoll is no longer your enemy when wearing a greegree!</str>
done	
done	<str>If you want to skip going to talk to Kruk and you brought mithril seeds or tinderbox and logs you can stand on the east side of the Elder Guard and plant the mithril seeds or light a fire to be force moved one tile west and thus bypass needing to talk to Kruk or to Garkor.</str>
done	
done	<str>Follow the red path, go through the gates, then walk east to the coast and talk to Garkor.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to the nearby Elder Guard.</str>
done	
done	<str>Head to the west coast of the island (orange path), then climb up the hill to the south.</str>
done	
done	<str>Climb the ladder, walk across the bridge, climb down, and talk to Kruk.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Awowogei.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Awowogei again. Then talk to the Elder Guard again to be let out.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Garkor and watch the cutscene.</str>
done	
done	<str>Talk to Garkor again to get the 10th squad sigil.</str>
done	
done	<str>Prepare for final battle.</str>
done	
done	<str>Equip the 10th squad sigil when you are ready to fight the Jungle Demon.</str>
done	
done	<str>Kill the Jungle Demon.</str>
done	
done	<str>Return to the Grand Tree and talk to King Narnode Shareen.</str>
done	
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
